cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the dataset or these examples, please cite the data paper."
title: "AliCPT beam systematics and deprojection - example notebooks"
abstract: >-
  Example notebooks that read the beam-mismatch parameters and the simulated
  maps of the AliCPT beam-systematics and deprojection dataset and reproduce
  its three Technical Validation figures. The dataset itself is hosted on the
  IHEP/CAS AliCPT data server and is not part of this repository.
version: 1.0.0
